WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.420
Another thing Dr. Bright is now allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.520
There is no such thing as the SCP Inquisition!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.210
Dr. Bright has recently taken to sneaking
up on people in quiet moments and startling

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.509
them by yelling "No one expects the SCP Inquisition!"

00:00:15.509 --> 00:00:19.810
While this is technically true, and no one
does expect it, that is only because there

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.510
is no SCP Inquisition.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.930
There never has been, so of course no one
would expect it.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:30.199
Can someone get Dr. Bright a new comedy sketch
to reference?

